From 51b6341429861dd9129a50ffab6a52ad93085845 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:02:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Site audit and SEO fixes; descriptive DIV credit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Form and privacy
- The sign-up form works without JavaScript: real POST form, named fields,
  required + pattern on the mobile number, +91 prefix. The API answers a
  plain form post with a redirect to /registered.
- Consent checkbox (DPDP Act), checked in the browser and the API; the
  record stores consentAt. New /privacy notice.

Accessibility and performance
- Alt text on every meaningful image; hero cards load with priority and the
  Wi-Fi photo is preloaded. Image sizes fixed so cover-cropped photos are
  no longer upscaled.
- Contrast fixes on the magenta and green panels; in-text links underlined;
  44px tap targets for footer, email and logo links.

SEO
- robots.txt, sitemap.xml, web manifest, app icons, apple-touch-icon and a
  1200x630 JPG share image.
- JSON-LD: Organization (FAB5, Samridhi), WebSite with DIV as creator,
  FAQPage.
- X-Robots-Tag noindex on *.vercel.app hosts.
- Footer credit: "Powered by <Div/> · Website by DIV, a software
  development company in Noida", a followed link to DIV's case study.

Layout and copy
- Programme cards wrap into centred rows (no lone card); Our promise panel
  in two columns without the stray logo; FAQ intro and contact box under
  the heading; FAQ in the top nav; nav highlight follows every section;
  footer wordmark no longer clipped; consistent .si colour.
- One tagline per programme everywhere; Stories caption no longer repeats
  itself; consistent FAB5 naming; /image-credits page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWqfHD2oNeP3Rmi6Wi9KMs
